**Given:**

frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2^k times 2k⁺²}{2^k times 2k⁺³ - 2² times 2²k}

**Formula used:**

am × aⁿ = am⁺ⁿ

**Calculation:**

frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2k⁺k⁺²}{2k⁺k⁺³ - 2²⁺²k}

⇒ frac{2²k⁺¹ - 2²k⁺²}{2²k⁺³ - 2²k⁺²}

⇒ frac{2²k times (2¹ - 2²)}{2²k times (2³ - 2²)}

⇒ (2 - 4)/(8 - 4)

⇒ (-2)/(4)

⇒ -(1)/(2)

**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**
